    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash skills with precision and feel the ultimate control\u2014then let your auto-weapons sweep through hordes in a single blast!<br><strong>Ebonor</strong> is a roguelite survival-action game that seamlessly blends <strong>manual skill casting</strong> with <strong>auto-attacking weapons</strong>. Play as the chosen survivor, battling waves of monsters across ever-shifting ruins and otherworldly battlegrounds.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom to Build, Adapt in Real Time</strong><br>In every run, choose from dozens of passive weapons, diverse auxiliary skills, and upgrade modules. Swap, upgrade, or rebirth them on the fly in the shop. There\u2019s no absolute best build\u2014only the strategy that fits the moment: high-speed combos or ranged obliteration? Elemental chains or creeping poison?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visceral Impact, Bullet-Hell Carnage</strong><br>Feel the heat of fire, the freeze of ice, the spread of toxic miasma with every skill cast. Auto-attacks rain down like a storm behind you, letting you focus on casting and dodging, delivering a true hack-and-slash spectacle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replay, Deep Simulation</strong><br>Procedurally generated layouts, terrains, and enemy spawns keep the challenge escalating. Every death is a lesson in strategy; every victory, proof of your build\u2019s power.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into this crucible of life and death\u2014forge your legend through tactics and reflexes.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680960/extras/db00e344cf2d336e2e08fafbbdde118c.poster.avif?t=1755480283\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680960/extras/db00e344cf2d336e2e08fafbbdde118c.webm?t=1755480283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680960/extras/db00e344cf2d336e2e08fafbbdde118c.mp4?t=1755480283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680960/extras/bbc3cc9b0b8e06f03562683b650104b9.poster.avif?t=1755480283\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680960/extras/bbc3cc9b0b8e06f03562683b650104b9.webm?t=1755480283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680960/extras/bbc3cc9b0b8e06f03562683b650104b9.mp4?t=1755480283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash skills with precision and feel the ultimate control\u2014then let your auto-weapons sweep through hordes in a single blast!<br><strong>Ebonor</strong> is a roguelite survival-action game that seamlessly blends <strong>manual skill casting</strong> with <strong>auto-attacking weapons</strong>. Play as the chosen survivor, battling waves of monsters across ever-shifting ruins and otherworldly battlegrounds.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom to Build, Adapt in Real Time</strong><br>In every run, choose from dozens of passive weapons, diverse auxiliary skills, and upgrade modules. Swap, upgrade, or rebirth them on the fly in the shop. There\u2019s no absolute best build\u2014only the strategy that fits the moment: high-speed combos or ranged obliteration? Elemental chains or creeping poison?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visceral Impact, Bullet-Hell Carnage</strong><br>Feel the heat of fire, the freeze of ice, the spread of toxic miasma with every skill cast. Auto-attacks rain down like a storm behind you, letting you focus on casting and dodging, delivering a true hack-and-slash spectacle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replay, Deep Simulation</strong><br>Procedurally generated layouts, terrains, and enemy spawns keep the challenge escalating. Every death is a lesson in strategy; every victory, proof of your build\u2019s power.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into this crucible of life and death\u2014forge your legend through tactics and reflexes.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680960/extras/db00e344cf2d336e2e08fafbbdde118c.poster.avif?t=1755480283\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680960/extras/db00e344cf2d336e2e08fafbbdde118c.webm?t=1755480283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680960/extras/db00e344cf2d336e2e08fafbbdde118c.mp4?t=1755480283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680960/extras/bbc3cc9b0b8e06f03562683b650104b9.poster.avif?t=1755480283\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680960/extras/bbc3cc9b0b8e06f03562683b650104b9.webm?t=1755480283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680960/extras/bbc3cc9b0b8e06f03562683b650104b9.mp4?t=1755480283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Ebonor is a survival roguelike combining building with fast hack-and-slash combat. Weapons auto-attack, skill combos are free, and the pace is exhilarating\u2014each run feels fresh. There\u2019s no ultimate build, only the strategy that fits each situation to create your own system.",
